Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.61,0:23:28.90,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE SELANJUTNYA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.67,0:01:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau adik dan sahabat\Nyang kupercayai selama ini
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ternyata berbohong,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mungkin aku akan mengurung diri\Nselama satu bulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin kita pun tidak dipercaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan, dong! Aku mau akur saja sama Yuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak dipercaya pun biar saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:01:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toh, aku benci anak-anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Apa Hana membenciku juga?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini biaya makanku bulan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, terima kasih!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku terima.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak perlu bayar tagihan lain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak usah, cukup biaya makan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.55,0:02:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tinggal urusan sekolah,\Nusiamu 13 tahun, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.43,0:02:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}SMP, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.22,0:02:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perlu izin pindah sekolah, dong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.39,0:02:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak mau sekolah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong ajarkan aku cara memakai senjata.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.95,0:02:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin menjadi kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, tidak usah kalau memang tidak mau.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:03:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ada cara mendapat pendidikan\Ntanpa harus ke sekolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak yang tahu celah\Nseperti itu di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya boleh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian mayoritas pihak Desa Higashi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dikucilkan masyarakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, makan yang banyak biar jadi kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berat badan itu penting kalau bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan dan jadilah lebih besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat makan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, meski makan banyak,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tubuhmu begitu ramping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal aku ingin tambah besar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Kakak…\N- Enak saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih berani memanggil "kakak"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma aku yang boleh memanggilnya kakak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, cuma panggilan itu yang dia tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mohon maklum, Asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah kamu selamat, partnerku!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Aku terkejut waktu keberadaanmu\Nterasa di dataran rendah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf membuatmu khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asa dibilang berada di situ\Ndemi melindungi desa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira itu memang demi kebaikan desa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Bodohnya, aku tidak pernah curiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Maaf,\Ndipikir-pikir lagi itu memang janggal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengurung seorang gadis manis\Ndi tempat gelap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Kakak! Jelas manis, lah!\NDia meniru wujudku!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}{\i1}Kok fokusnya ke situ?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}{\i1}Hore, Kakak menyebutku manis!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Lagi, dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ogah! Enggak akan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.74,0:04:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan sungkan, peluklah adik manismu ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar adik menyebalkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, selama ini Kakak telah…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, ampun! Maaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku harus panggil apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.55,0:05:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Panggil nama saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pura-pura menjadi Asa
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}demi menahan Yuru di desa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu tidak bisa terus-menerus begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kamu selalu baik
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menemuiku tiap hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Obrolan sepele pun
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terasa menyenangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati kecilku berharap
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.42,0:05:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hubungan itu bisa bertahan selamanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Maafkan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Maafkan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:05:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak perlu menyamar lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kembalilah ke wujud asalmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.62,0:06:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Imutnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kecil sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Siapa nama aslimu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Nama asliku?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Kyouka memberimu nama, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Karena bunga kiri yang mekar\Ndi Desa Higashi sangat indah.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.97,0:06:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya. Nama yang bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Namaku artinya anak laki-laki yang sehat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Danji? Sesuai, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}- Partner.\N- Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami akan bercerita sejujurnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Dahulu, Desa Higashi adalah kastel utama{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}dengan beberapa dusun kecil\Nyang jadi cabangnya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Kami disembah sebagai Zashiki Warashi\Ndi salah satu dusun kecil itu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Kami beberapa kali berganti tuan,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}semuanya baik hati dan sederhana.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Kami sangat mencintai dusun itu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.93,0:07:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya di kastel utama ada Tsugai\Nbernama Penjaga Ilahi Sayuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, jadi ingin melihatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Akan ada perang besar.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar Tuan Higashimura juga andil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perang dengan siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dusun kita juga diminta mengirim
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}beberapa pemuda tangguh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Perang itu kurang lebih\Nsekitar 400 tahun lalu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada kabar baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan berperang bersama\NTuan Higashimura!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan berjasa dan dapat banyak uang!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bawa kami juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami pasti berguna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.09,0:07:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senang mendengarnya,\Ntapi medan perang itu berbahaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.47,0:07:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami pengin ikut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takutnya kalian jadi Tsugai liar\Nkalau aku kenapa-kenapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putus dulu kontraknya\Nbiar kalian jadi relik.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau aku pulang nanti,\Nmari buat kontrak lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maukah kalian jadi Tsugai-ku lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menantikan kisah darimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Kemudian kami kembali jadi relik{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}sambil menunggu kepulangannya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Lalu kami tahu hasil perang\Ndari rumor yang beredar.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasukan Timur yang menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimenangkan Pasukan Timur 400 tahun lalu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perang Sekigahara, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekigahara?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di sini sebutannya itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, perang perebutan kekuasaan\N400 tahun lalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, aku baru tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak itu, pemerintahan Tokugawa\Nberlangsung 200 tahun lebih.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Higashimura juga ikut perang, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau menang dan berjasa,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seharusnya dia jadi kisah\Nturun-temurun desa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, dapat wilayah kekuasaan pun tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin dia tidak berjasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau justru
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dia bikin ulah yang\Ntidak boleh diceritakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.89,0:09:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan lama kalian ikut perang,\Npasti dia tahu sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tidak cerita?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan lama kami tidak kembali lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Kami percaya dia akan kembali\Ndan membuat kontrak lagi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Hingga tahun demi tahun berlalu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Lama-lama, suara warga mulai berkurang.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Dan kami pun terlupakan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:10:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Dusunnya terbengkalai\Ndan tidak lagi dihuni.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Kupikir, kami akan hancur perlahan\Ntanpa bisa membuat kontrak{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}dengan orang baru.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, ketemu! Sesuai legendanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.11,0:10:18.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian pasti kesepian, ayo ikut aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Seorang pria datang mencari kami\Nberdasarkan cerita{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}legenda Zashiki Warashi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Namanya Rouei, seorang Abdi Desa Higashi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rouei kan Tadera pendahulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, ayahnya Dera.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayahnya Dera?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rouei yang membawa kami ke Desa Higashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.55,0:10:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Di situlah Tuan Kyouka alias Ibu{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.31,0:10:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}membuat kontrak dengan kami.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Saat itu, Ibu terpukul luar biasa\Nkarena longsor merenggut{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}suami dan dua anaknya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:11:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Mungkin agar meringankan duka itu,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Rouei membimbing Ibu dan kami\Nuntuk menjalin kontrak.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tuan baru kami?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beri kami nama baru, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak-anak ini adalah Tsugai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Betul.\N- Meski aku tahu legendanya…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Main apa hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami akan selalu bersamamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Ibu terlihat sedih sekaligus senang.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, itu Tsugai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Zashiki Warashi, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertanda baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Kyouka, datanglah ke kastel pusat\Nkalau sudah sembuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bekerjalah di tempatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Nenek itu bisa melihat kami, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Mungkin dia pengguna Tsugai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Orang biasa tidak bisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Cuma pengguna Tsugai,\Norang yang diizinkan Tsugai,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}dan orang peka saja yang bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa melihat karena punya Tsugai\Ndi dataran rendah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa nenek itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.41,0:12:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia Nenek Yamaha, kepala desa ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia yang tertua di desa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan dia sampai lupa usianya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Nagisa tersasar ke desa{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}tidak lama setelah Ibu\Nmulai bekerja di kastel.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Saat itu, kupikir bajunya agak aneh.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Mungkin itu baju terkini orang luar desa.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Nagisa murung saat tahu tidak bisa pulang.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Mine berusaha menghibur\NNagisa yang malang.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau makan babi rebus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar ceria lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar kurang sensitif.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sitif itu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak apa-apa, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa lebih ceria.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Akhirnya, Yuru dan Asa lahir.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Dan ekspresi orang-orang mulai berubah.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Kami juga pendatang, kurang tahu\Nsoal legenda kuno Desa Higashi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Kami cuma tahu legenda Kai dan Fuu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.05,0:14:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekuatan yang besar membuat\Norang-orang jadi gila.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Ibu terlihat ingin mengatakan sesuatu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Tapi dia tidak cerita banyak.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fuu…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kai juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar diurus para bandit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelamaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau kapan Desa Higashi berjaya lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang Ibu obrolkan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan apa-apa. Tidurlah, Azami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau berburu? Aku ikut.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi-lagi? Jangan ikut melulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Ke gunung sendirian itu berbahaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu cuma mau bolos bertani, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tepat sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Sisanya, seperti yang Yuru tahu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Ibu terpaksa minta Kiri jadi Asa palsu\Natas perintah Nenek.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi di belakang Nenek Yamaha,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu menyuruhku melindungi Yuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Danji dan Kiri, keluarlah duluan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau bicara dengan Asa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berdua saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.59,0:15:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Momen berharga sama Kakak!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat keluarkan mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yin-Yang,\Nkeluarkan Zashiki Warashi duluan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengar, Yuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Asa memang pernah menyerang desa,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}tapi dia tidak membunuh seorang pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski Ibu kena reruntuhan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asa tidak membunuh satu pun warga desa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak mau sok suci.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:16:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kebetulan saja tidak ada\Nyang kubunuh hari itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Tiada kata ampun bagi orang yang mengincar
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}orang yang kusayangi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu selalu jujur padaku\Nsejak kita bertemu lagi, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hal-hal berat dan menyedihkan pun
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.01,0:16:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu ceritakan terus terang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, Kakak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sosok mungil, imut, dan polos
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asa yang kamu kenal…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Sudah tidak ada lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku juga mau terus terang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.45,0:16:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama sepuluh tahun\Nsejak kepergian Ayah dan Ibu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Danji dan Kiri adalah penyemangatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka sangat berarti.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski berat ditinggalkan orang tua,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bertahan karena punya teman dan adik.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan walau palsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka memberiku semangat hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah tidak bisa menyalahkan mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak adil!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma enam tahun, mereka sepuluh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan mustahil menukarnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan kalau dihitung sejak aku\Nmulai punya ingatan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kenangan kita berdua lebih sedikit lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Tidak adil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.26,0:17:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Adakah hal yang ingin kamu capai\Natau inginkan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.14,0:17:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu punya cita-cita, tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada, aku mau ke disneyland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dis? Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau memborong barang lucu,\Nmenikmati banyak wahana,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan foto di istana Cinderella!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.19,0:17:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Selain itu, mau nonton\N{\i1}- Istana? Ada penguasanya, dong?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.82,0:17:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- bisbol sama Kakak!\N{\i1}- Bayarnya berapa?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Main bersama di tempat seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergi sekolah dan mengeluh soal pelajaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Merengek minta pacar yang keren.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengeluhkan pekerjaan sambil naik kereta.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin hidup normal seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma bercanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.13,0:18:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mustahil bagiku yang ada\Ndi dunia saling bunuh ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di impian hidup normal itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ada aku, Ayah, dan Ibu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu ayo bangun sama-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk sepuluh tahun lagi atau lebih.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo halau semua musuh,\Ntemukan Ayah dan Ibu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan hidup bahagia bersama-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu kita main ke dis…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau istana apalah itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, aku punya info baru\Nsoal Ayah dan Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:19:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang mengajari mereka\Ncara keluar desa sepuluh tahun lalu
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah Rouei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayahnya Dera?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aneh sekali, Ayah dan Ibu\Ntidak pernah memberitahuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya Rouei bisa dianggap\Nmemberontak ke Desa Higashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin Ayah dan Ibu tutup mulut\Nuntuk membalas jasanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Rouei punya dua putra,\NDera dan satunya lagi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Keduanya tidak tahu Rouei ke mana.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin saja Ayah dan Ibu
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:32.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}masih berkabar dengan Rouei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Aku dan Dera akan mencari Rouei.\N- Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu lagi, seorang pengguna Tsugai katana
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tahu sesuatu soal hilangnya Ayah dan Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Katana?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yosano Ivan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.31,0:19:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bilang apa? Di mana Ayah dan Ibu?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:20:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Asa, dengarkan baik-baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bilang telah menebas Ayah dan Ibu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ivan mengaku telah membunuh\Norang tua kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selebihnya, dia kabur sebelum kutanyai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.55,0:20:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asa, tenanglah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah dan Ibu…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini salahku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Ini karena mereka kabur membawaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Mereka terlibat ini karena aku lahir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asa! Tenanglah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu cuma ucapannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Jangan percaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Dunia ini penuh tipu daya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Lihatlah sendiri baru percaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bilang Ayah dan Ibu\Nakan baik-baik saja, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenanglah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bernapaslah perlahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, mereka pasti baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari kita selamatkan kalau mereka diculik.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu kita berempat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan hidup bahagia seperti biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengguna Tsugai katana itu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.57,0:21:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kontraknya harus kuhapus dengan Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak, kalau bertemu lagi,\Npancing dia kepadaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama dalam jarak pandang,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa mengenainya sejauh mana pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penjaga Ilahi Sayuu ingat bau darahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kami yang menggiringnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.49,0:23:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat malam, Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Dihancurkan?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Aku juga\Ntidak paham rasa sakit orang lain.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Aku merasakan perasaan\Nyang belum pernah ada.{\i0}
